<http://data.silknow.org/event/bbafc19f-2739-3e9d-aa87-1547a2dd7224>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "<b>Description from the acquisition register</b>\n\nParasol, with cover of green silk damask, woven with a floral pattern, and having a border woven with the rose, thistle and shamrock; there is a fringe and lining of white silk. The handle is of ivory, carved in relief with dragons, birds and flowers.\n\nThe cover, English; the handle, Chinese; middle of the 19th century."@en ;
        ecrm:P14_carried_out_by        <http://data.silknow.org/actor/7271d9f0-8213-38c6-8920-173f7a70e454> ;
